      "text": "## The Big Picture"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#002",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:topology:00-overview, git-history:topology:00-overview]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "concepts": "[overview]",
        "current_path": "topology/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:overview",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Topology - Landscape Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nTOPOLOGY — DEPENDENCY FLOW AND MODERN DEVELOPMENTS\n+====================================================================+\n|  LAYER 1: POINT-SET FOUNDATIONS                                    |\n|  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐    |\n|  │  Metric spaces → Topological spaces → Compactness          │    |\n|  │  Connectedness → Separation axioms → Metrization           │    |\n|  │  (01–05 in this guide)                                     │    |\n|  └─────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┘    |\n|                            ▼                                       |\n|  LAYER 2: ALGEBRAIC TOPOLOGY                                      |\n|  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐    |\n|  │  π₁(X) fundamental group ─── Van Kampen ─── Covering spaces│    |\n|  │  Homology Hₙ(X) ─── Cohomology Hⁿ(X) ─── Exact sequences   │    |\n|  │  Euler characteristic ─── Poincaré duality                 │    |\n|  │  (06–08 in this guide)                                     │    |\n|  └──────────┬─────────────────────────┬───────────────────────┘    |\n|             ▼                         ▼                            |\n|  LAYER 3: DIFFERENTIAL TOPOLOGY    LAYER 3: APPLICATIONS           |\n|  ┌──────────────────────────┐     ┌───────────────────────────┐   |\n|  │  Smooth manifolds (09)   │     │  TDA / persistent homology│   |\n|  │  Tangent bundles, forms  │     │  Topological phases (TKNN)│   |\n|  │  Morse theory, cobordism │     │  Robotics / config spaces │   |\n|  │  De Rham cohomology      │     │  Knot theory (DNA, QC)    │   |\n|  └──────────┬───────────────┘     └───────────────────────────┘   |\n|             ▼                                                      |\n|  LAYER 4: MODERN FOUNDATIONS                                       |\n|  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐    |\n|  │  ∞-categories: (∞,1)-category of spaces, ∞-topoi (Lurie)   │    |\n|  │  HoTT: types = spaces, paths = proofs, univalence axiom    │    |\n|  │  Derived algebraic geometry: derived ∞-categories, E∞-alg  │    |\n|  │  Cobordism hypothesis: classifies TQFTs via ∞-categories   │    |\n|  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘    |\n+====================================================================+\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#003",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
