        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Topology - Landscape Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "From these three axioms: continuous maps, homeomorphisms, and ALL of topology.\n```"
    },
