        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Topology - Landscape Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "PHYSICS CONNECTION:\n  Configuration space of a mechanical system = a manifold.\n  Phase space = cotangent bundle (canonical symplectic structure).\n  Topological phases of matter (TKNN invariant, Chern numbers) — see 10-APPLICATIONS.md.\n  Fiber bundles: gauge theories (electromagnetism = U(1) bundle, Yang-Mills = non-abelian)."
    },
