        "title": "Topology - Landscape Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "DATA SCIENCE CONNECTION:\n  Topological Data Analysis: shape of data modeled by persistent homology.\n  Mapper algorithm: \"coarse topology\" of data clouds.\n  Neural networks: topology of loss landscapes.\n```"
